    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze Puli umwami wa Ashuri atera igihugu ca Isirayeli, Menahemu amuha italanto igihumbi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’amatoni 38.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " z’ifeza, kugira ngo amufashe gukomeza ubwami bwiwe, anamufashe no kuguma ku ngoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahemu akura ayo mahera mu butunzi bwa Isirayeli. Umutunzi wese yasabwa gutanga n’imiburiburi shekeli mirongo itanu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’amagarama 575.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " z’ifeza zo guha umwami wa Ashuri. Maze umwami wa Ashuri ntiyaba agitera Isirayeli, ava no muri ico gihugu asubira inyuma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
